{
  "Name": "Calculate Client Security Hash",
  "ProjectType": "Process",
  "Description": "The bot logs into the system, navigates through the dashboard to access the Work Items queue, and identifies tasks of type WI5. For each WI5 item, the automation extracts client-specific data (Client ID and Client Country), generates a SHA1 hash value using an external web tool, and updates the work item status to “Completed” with the generated hash as a comment.",
